<h1>Deleting all changes for user {@user.name}</h1>
<div class="block block--fixed block--warning">
  <p>This is IRREVERSIBLE.</p>
  <p>All user details will be destroyed.</p>
  <p>Are you really, really sure?</p>
</div>
<div class="field">{button_to "Abort", ~p"/profiles/#{@user}", class: "button"} {button_to "Erase user", ~p"/admin/users/#{@user}/erase", method: "post", class: "button button--state-danger"} </div>
<p>This automatically creates user and IP bans but does not create a fingerprint ban. Check to see if one is necessary after erasing. </p>
